      "url": "https://lifepacific.edu/strategic-plan",
      "summary": "Life Pacific University's strategic plan, 'The Next 100: Transforming the Generations,' builds upon the institution’s rich heritage and commitment to empowering students for service in the church and broader society. The plan comprises five core themes, focusing on resource stewardship, vibrant institutional culture, student success through transformative learning, strategic partnerships, and enhancing brand visibility. Approved in February 2021, the plan sets a clear trajectory for LPU to celebrate its centennial and beyond by intentionally engaging community members and stakeholders in shared objectives.",
